      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Entonces una vocecita dijo: «Yo lo intento». Era la Rata Almizclera.",
          "en": "Then a small voice said, \"I will try.\" It was the Muskrat."
        },
        {
          "es": "Algunos se rieron. «¿Tú? Eres tan pequeña», le dijeron.",
          "en": "Some of the others laughed. \"You? You are so small,\" they said."
        },
        {
          "es": "La Rata Almizclera no contestó. Respiró hondo y se zambulló.",
          "en": "The Muskrat did not answer. She took a deep breath, and she dove."
        }
      ],
